# Answer 9 · From WAF to Digital Activism: Legal Rights to Bodily Autonomy (CSS 2026)
@py question 2026-3

## The answer map
::: fig mindmap | The answer map: every branch is one numbered heading of the model answer below.
@note Part one traces the evolution in dated stages from 1981 to the 2020s; part two explains the shift in the locus of resistance — what changed, why, and what stayed the same.
@ask ① TRACE the EVOLUTION from WAF against the HUDOOD ORDINANCES (1980s) to DIGITAL ACTIVISM (2020s)
@ask ② HOW has the LOCUS OF RESISTANCE shifted from "LEGAL RIGHTS" to "BODILY AUTONOMY"?
