(6) The 2020s: Aurat March since 2018; hashtags, testimony and online outrage; the 2021 anti-rape law
(7) What shifted: from repealing bad laws to claiming safety, consent and choice over one's body
(8) Why it shifted: laws won but violence continued; new generation; global fourth wave; body as site of control
